{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22335","headline":"酬张太祝晚秋卧病见寄 · 白居易","name":"酬张太祝晚秋卧病见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高才淹礼寺，短羽翔禁林。\n西街居处远，北阙官曹深。\n君病不来访，我忙难往寻。\n差池终日别，寥落经年心。\n露湿绿芜地，月寒红树阴。\n况兹独愁夕，闻彼相思吟。\n上叹言笑阻，下嗟时岁侵。\n容衰晓窗镜，思苦秋弦琴。\n一章锦绣段，八韵琼瑶音。\n何以报珍重，慙无双南金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}